* Experiment 22 isolated TIA neuron n1
* frozen n=16 L1=4.9158066 b=0.0857431075924666
* A=100000 vos=0 Ileak=0 Rout=0 fp=0 invertA=1e+07
* Behavioral TIA. Not transistor-level. Weights were not edited.
* shape: 16 -> 1 (linear Vlin vs z unless ReLU requested)

* Experiment 26 MOS primitive. Models included, not copied.
.include "C:/ngspice/examples/xspice/see/CMOSOpAmp/modelcard.nmos"
.include "C:/ngspice/examples/xspice/see/CMOSOpAmp/modelcard.pmos"

.subckt NCH D G S B W=1u L=1.4u m=1
MN1 D G S B N1 W={W} L={L} M={m} AS={3*L*W} AD={3*L*W} PS={6*L+W} PD={6*L+W}
.ends NCH

.subckt PCH D G S B W=1u L=1.4u m=1
MP1 D G S B P1 W={W} L={L} M={m} AS={3*L*W} AD={3*L*W} PS={6*L+W} PD={6*L+W}
.ends PCH

* Two-stage Miller CMOS OTA. Topology from ngspice CMOS-OP1, dual supply.
* Bodies to rails. Analog ground is node 0.
.subckt miller_tia inp inn out vdd vss
.param L=1.4u WD=2.8u WT=5.0u WL=2.8u
+ WOP=14.5u WON=17.4u WDI=5.0u
+ MD=2 MT=2 MO=4 CC=2p IBIAS=40u DW=0 L1=1.4u
Ibias vdd vb {IBIAS}
Xdiode vb vb vss vss NCH W={WDI} L={L} m={MT}
Xtail vs vb vss vss NCH W={WT} L={L} m={MT}
* Diode load on IN- drain (CMOS-OP1 polarity). DW unbalances the pair.
Xdp dplus inp vs vss NCH W={WD*(1+DW)} L={L1} m={MD}
Xdn dmin inn vs vss NCH W={WD*(1-DW)} L={L1} m={MD}
Xln dmin dmin vdd vdd PCH W={WL} L={L1} m={MD}
Xlp dplus dmin vdd vdd PCH W={WL} L={L1} m={MD}
Xop out dplus vdd vdd PCH W={WOP} L={L} m={MO}
Xon out vb vss vss NCH W={WON} L={L} m={MO}
Cc dplus out {CC}
.ends miller_tia

* Telescopic-cascode first stage + Miller CS. Higher DC gain for o2 load.
.subckt miller_cascode inp inn out vdd vss
.param L=1.4u WD=2.8u WT=5.0u WL=2.8u
+ WOP=14.5u WON=17.4u WDI=5.0u WC=2.8u
+ MD=2 MT=2 MO=4 CC=2p IBIAS=40u DW=0
Ibias vdd vb {IBIAS}
Xdiode vb vb vss vss NCH W={WDI} L={L} m={MT}
Xstack vcn vcn vb vss NCH W={WDI} L={L} m={MT}
Xtail vs vb vss vss NCH W={WT} L={L} m={MT}
Xdp splus inp vs vss NCH W={WD*(1+DW)} L={L} m={MD}
Xdn smin inn vs vss NCH W={WD*(1-DW)} L={L} m={MD}
Xcn dplus vcn splus vss NCH W={WC} L={L} m={MD}
Xcm dmin vcn smin vss NCH W={WC} L={L} m={MD}
Xln dmin dmin vdd vdd PCH W={WL} L={L} m={MD}
Xlp dplus dmin vdd vdd PCH W={WL} L={L} m={MD}
Xop out dplus vdd vdd PCH W={WOP} L={L} m={MO}
Xon out vb vss vss NCH W={WON} L={L} m={MO}
Cc dplus out {CC}
.ends miller_cascode

* 5-transistor OTA used as a slow integrator (capacitive load).
.subckt servo_ota inp inn out vdd vss
.param L=1.4u WD=2.8u WT=5.0u WL=2.8u
+ MD=1 MT=1 IBIAS=2u DW=0
Ibias vdd vb {IBIAS}
Xdiode vb vb vss vss NCH W={WT} L={L} m={MT}
Xtail vs vb vss vss NCH W={WT} L={L} m={MT}
Xdp dplus inp vs vss NCH W={WD*(1+DW)} L={L} m={MD}
Xdn dmin inn vs vss NCH W={WD*(1-DW)} L={L} m={MD}
Xlp dplus dplus vdd vdd PCH W={WL} L={L} m={MD}
Xln out dplus vdd vdd PCH W={WL} L={L} m={MD}
.ends servo_ota

* Experiment 26 device TIA  VDD=2.5 VSS=-2.5
* Ibias=4e-05 m_diff=2 m_out=4 Cc=2e-12
* servo=True vos_inject=0 dw_frac=0.00185
* Weights were not edited. SPICE is not Python-corrected.
Vdd vdd 0 DC 2.5
Vss vss 0 DC -2.5
.temp 27
.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 vntol=1e-8

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0.991664696216928
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0.921092462049841
Vin3 in3 0 DC 0.578218548268848
Vin4 in4 0 DC 0.0269757344529336
Vin5 in5 0 DC -0.434547784694714
* passive invert in5 -> in5n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv5ia in5 inv5m 10000
Rinv5ib in5n inv5m 10000.0020000002
Einv5amp in5n 0 0 inv5m 10000000
Vin6 in6 0 DC 0.206636426851205
Vin7 in7 0 DC -0.241062585681472
Vin8 in8 0 DC -0.863015815292251
Vin9 in9 0 DC -0.812323549234783
* passive invert in9 -> in9n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv9ia in9 inv9m 10000
Rinv9ib in9n inv9m 10000.0020000002
Einv9amp in9n 0 0 inv9m 10000000
Vin10 in10 0 DC 0.709477959094462
* passive invert in10 -> in10n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv10ia in10 inv10m 10000
Rinv10ib in10n inv10m 10000.0020000002
Einv10amp in10n 0 0 inv10m 10000000
Vin11 in11 0 DC 0.970954563086739
Vin12 in12 0 DC 0.364403651354763
Vin13 in13 0 DC 0.0859477023464112
Vin14 in14 0 DC 0.409408967116273
Vin15 in15 0 DC 0.604937343512566
Vin16 in16 0 DC -0.236918133906935
Vref vref 0 DC 1
* passive invert vref -> vrefn: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinvrefia vref invrefm 10000
Rinvrefib vrefn invrefm 10000.0020000002
Einvrefamp vrefn 0 0 invrefm 10000000

* n1 input 1 w=-0.211528252190937 w-  bank=n alpha=1 R=157583.362922343 G_phys=6.3458475657281e-06 G_eff=6.3458475657281e-06
Rn1n1n1 in1 n1p 157583.362922343
* n1 input 2 w=-0.194947045242045 w-  bank=n alpha=1 R=170986.604551748 G_phys=5.84841135726135e-06 G_eff=5.84841135726135e-06
Rn1n2n1 in2 n1p 170986.604551748
* n1 input 3 w=-0.281660896127353 w-  bank=n alpha=1 R=118345.619827403 G_phys=8.44982688382059e-06 G_eff=8.44982688382059e-06
Rn1n3n1 in3 n1p 118345.619827403
