* n1 input 5 w=+0.785179968580328 w+  bank=n alpha=1 R=42453.112238208 G_phys=2.35553990574098e-05 G_eff=2.35553990574098e-05
Rn1p5n1 in5n n1p 42453.112238208
* n1 input 6 w=-0.342055263707418 w-  bank=n alpha=1 R=97450.1399921314 G_phys=1.02616579112226e-05 G_eff=1.02616579112226e-05
Rn1n6n1 in6 n1p 97450.1399921314
