Rn1p10n1 in10n n1p 79611.0064440994
* n1 input 11 w=-0.38263995973155 w-  bank=n alpha=1 R=87114.0937729534 G_phys=1.14791987919465e-05 G_eff=1.14791987919465e-05
Rn1n11n1 in11 n1p 87114.0937729534
